          "id": "mama-result",
          "label": "開けた",
          "rationale": "Keeps the window in the open state established that morning."
        },
        {
          "id": "mama-undone",
          "label": "開けない",
          "rationale": "Would mean working without opening the window, but the speaker has explicitly opened it."
